response:
An incident investigated by CERT-UA where threat actor UAC-0140 sent malicious emails with the subject regarding kamikaze drones to Ukrainian targets including Ukrzaliznytsia. The emails impersonated the State Emergency Service of Ukraine using the spoofed domain dsns.com.ua and email morgunov.a@dsns.com.ua. The email contained a RAR archive named shahed-136.rar with a PPSX file shahed.ppsx, which dropped SearchEmbdIndex.ps1 to download CodeMeter.exe and WibuCm32.dll, the latter being the DolphinCape malware executed via DLL side-loading.

